        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lot 2 - Crowley, Shercock, Co. Cavan\r\n\r\nA family home with room around you, just 600m from Shercock Main Street.\r\n\r\nThis good-sized three-bedroom bungalow at Crowley offers a practical family home in a location that puts everyday life within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation provides a comfortable layout made for family living, with good living space alongside three well-proportioned bedrooms.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property comes with a useful shed and adjoining field, with the entire lot extending to c.1.27 acres. It gives you space around the home, room for hobbies, storage or outdoor use, without taking on a larger agricultural holding.\r\n\r\nLocation is a major part of the appeal. Shercock Main Street is just c.600m away, giving easy access to shops, schools, sports facilities and local amenities.\r\n\r\nFor buyers looking for a detached family home with land and useful outbuildings, while still being close to town, Lot 2 brings a lot together.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n- Good-sized three-bedroom bungalow\r\n- Lot extending to c.1.27 acres\r\n- Useful shed\r\n- Adjoining field\r\n- Practical layout suited to family living\r\n- Just c.600m from Shercock Main Street\r\n- Part of a larger c.18 acre holding offered in four lots"
      },
